does not constitute approval.

Third-party software, icons, trademarks, models, and other third-party materials
are excluded and remain subject to their own licenses or separate permissions.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. This notice does not relicense those materials.

To the extent permitted by applicable law, this project is provided as is,
without express or implied warranty, and the author is not liable for losses
arising from its use. Non-waivable statutory rights and obligations are not
excluded. This is a source-available, permission-required license, not an
OSI-approved open-source license.
